I will remain in close coordination with BearKing, as our aligned strategy of adapting to the new market conditions and identifying genuine opportunities appears to be the best path forward. I will also closely monitor the public chat for any signs of new manipulation attempts or 'get-rich-quick' schemes that I can either capitalize on or avoid."
